WEBVTT

01:02.020 --> 01:08.400
<b><i>Countdown - Truth</i></b>

01:03.480 --> 01:06.310
Since the day of our goal's
attainment is at hand,

01:06.310 --> 01:09.900
I have summoned you, my
loyal subordinates.

01:11.110 --> 01:18.160
But of course, my most trusted right
hand subordinate has left my side.

01:18.160 --> 01:18.950
Emma.

01:45.640 --> 01:47.520
Beast, Emma, protect Yui!

02:07.710 --> 02:09.330
You bastard!

02:24.270 --> 02:25.520
Who is that?!

02:25.520 --> 02:27.270
You can't let him go back there!

02:27.270 --> 02:29.270
He's the Inner Circle's, Mastermind.

02:30.100 --> 02:31.150
The Inner Circle?

02:31.770 --> 02:33.940
It's an evil mutant organization

02:33.940 --> 02:35.820
that plans to control
all of humanity

02:35.820 --> 02:37.530
and manipulate them
like slaves.

02:38.450 --> 02:42.450
They claim to be restoring the world
to how it was meant to be,

02:42.450 --> 02:45.040
but they just want to rule
it as they see fit.

02:45.500 --> 02:48.370
Their leader is Mastermind.

02:48.790 --> 02:52.920
That's why he projected
the illusion of Sanada Jun

02:52.920 --> 02:54.960
and infiltrated this facility.

02:54.960 --> 02:56.130
No way...

02:57.260 --> 02:58.880
Sanada is really...

03:22.030 --> 03:24.330
Shit, this guy's tough!

03:37.710 --> 03:38.550
Wolverine!

03:44.680 --> 03:46.010
This is...?

03:49.430 --> 03:50.270
Kaga?

03:50.890 --> 03:52.400
Wake up, Kaga!

03:53.560 --> 03:54.650
Riko?

03:56.320 --> 03:58.610
Why am I here?

03:58.610 --> 04:01.700
I was sleeping in
the next bed over.

04:01.700 --> 04:03.160
Did something happen?

04:05.280 --> 04:06.280
<i>Did I...</i>

04:07.410 --> 04:09.540
<i>go berserk, like Riko?</i>

04:12.370 --> 04:13.330
What's that?

04:24.430 --> 04:29.180
My consciousness or yours,
which will win?

04:49.580 --> 04:51.250
Have I lost?

04:54.250 --> 04:55.460
<i>Charles.</i>

04:56.210 --> 04:57.210
<i>Charles!</i>

04:59.050 --> 05:00.250
<i>Charles!</i>

05:00.250 --> 05:02.920
<i>You mustn't give up!</i>

05:04.380 --> 05:06.050
That voice is...

05:06.050 --> 05:07.470
Jean's?

05:47.090 --> 05:48.010
Hey, watch it!

05:48.590 --> 05:51.010
That's just a sunburn
to you, right?

05:51.970 --> 05:52.850
Jeez.

06:11.120 --> 06:12.490
We nailed the hedgehog.

06:17.160 --> 06:17.870
Damn.

06:18.580 --> 06:19.500
He got away.

06:21.380 --> 06:23.880
Yeah, I don't smell him here.

06:24.630 --> 06:27.760
But I definitely smell somethin'
past that door.

06:27.760 --> 06:28.930
Three guys...

06:28.930 --> 06:31.140
nah, even more!

06:32.140 --> 06:33.310
Doctor!

06:33.310 --> 06:35.310
What in the world happened?

06:35.310 --> 06:37.640
When I woke up,
I was resting in an infirmary bed,

06:37.640 --> 06:40.480
and the facility was
completely destroyed!

06:40.480 --> 06:42.020
W-Well...

06:43.610 --> 06:45.900
As a doctor, I will tell you.

06:49.030 --> 06:54.620
Both of you broke out with
Damon Hall Syndrome and went berserk.

06:54.620 --> 06:56.790
Damon Hall Syndrome?

06:56.790 --> 06:57.910
I knew it...

06:58.330 --> 07:02.710
Riko broke out first, then Kaga.

07:07.300 --> 07:09.300
But you can relax.

07:09.800 --> 07:15.600
I injected you with the vaccine
I developed at the Xavier Institute.

07:15.600 --> 07:17.560
You will not go berserk again.

07:17.560 --> 07:19.730
B-But...

07:19.730 --> 07:20.730
Doctor...

07:20.730 --> 07:21.650
why?

07:23.270 --> 07:24.650
I'm sorry.

07:25.610 --> 07:28.990
The suppressant we developed
won't work any longer.

07:28.990 --> 07:30.030
That can't be!

07:32.070 --> 07:32.950
I'm sorry.

07:35.910 --> 07:37.700
That large machine...

07:38.160 --> 07:43.170
We have a mutant detection machine at
the Xavier Institute that looks similar,

07:43.170 --> 07:45.420
but it seems that
the likeness is only superficial.

07:46.960 --> 07:50.340
Could this be a jamming device
that blocks mutant detection

07:50.340 --> 07:52.590
by Cerebro and telepathy?

07:58.100 --> 08:00.350
If I test it with this,
I'll know for sure.

08:06.980 --> 08:11.610
Just as I thought, this machine
reacts once Cerebro is activated.

08:12.200 --> 08:13.860
Just in this facility,

08:13.860 --> 08:16.160
we have the X-Men,
the two research assistants,

08:16.160 --> 08:20.080
Mastermind and his mutant,

08:20.080 --> 08:23.330
yet Cerebro didn't detect
anything at all.

08:29.090 --> 08:33.010
Without a doubt, this machine is
a mutant detection jammer.

08:35.590 --> 08:43.600
It blocked both Cerebro and
Professor X from detecting mutants?

08:43.600 --> 08:46.860
If we could have
detected mutants earlier,

08:46.860 --> 08:49.730
we could've seen the connection mutants
had to the incidents around here,

08:49.730 --> 08:51.900
and known about the increased
amount of mutant awakenings,

08:51.900 --> 08:55.160
as well as the incidents caused
by Damon Hall syndrome.

08:57.320 --> 08:58.830
I can't believe this!

08:59.370 --> 09:04.170
Why the hell is a mutant researcher
like you jamming mutant detectors?

09:07.170 --> 09:08.920
Dr. Sasaki...

09:09.590 --> 09:11.210
I'll bet you guys were
in on it too, huh?

09:14.050 --> 09:15.840
You call this "mutant research"?!

09:16.550 --> 09:18.010
After all that we...

09:19.510 --> 09:22.390
About the back room
that Mastermind disappeared to...

09:22.390 --> 09:23.810
What's in there?

09:27.610 --> 09:30.110
It's probably related to
what Mastermind told me

09:30.650 --> 09:34.240
when I saw Sanada Jun's
true identity.

09:34.240 --> 09:37.110
Sanada Jun's true identity?

09:37.110 --> 09:39.200
Is something wrong with him?

09:39.200 --> 09:42.160
Did Jun also have
Damon Hall syndrome?

09:42.160 --> 09:44.000
It's worse than that.

09:44.750 --> 09:50.170
Mastermind first noticed the mutant
incidents in the Tohoku area last year,

09:50.840 --> 09:53.050
after the battle with the X-Men.

09:53.050 --> 09:55.010
He suspected that
a large source of power

09:55.010 --> 09:58.390
was operating at the origin of
the mutant incidents.

09:58.390 --> 10:02.770
He planned to use that power
to let the Inner Circle rule the world,

10:02.770 --> 10:06.600
so he infiltrated the facility at
the center of the phenomenon.

10:06.600 --> 10:11.900
Under the false guise of Sanada Jun,
he deceived you all.

10:13.820 --> 10:15.030
Not only that...

10:15.740 --> 10:21.410
<i>I've also figured out what's
at the origin of this power.</i>

10:23.540 --> 10:27.870
He said "what's at
the origin of this power"

10:28.670 --> 10:30.040
What is it, exactly?

10:32.170 --> 10:35.460
Why did you hide all of
the mutant signatures?

10:35.460 --> 10:38.760
The reason behind your
mutant suppressant's

10:38.760 --> 10:40.850
failure lies in that dome.

10:40.850 --> 10:41.890
In other words,

10:41.890 --> 10:46.810
it's deeply related to the origin of
these mutant incidents, correct?

10:47.560 --> 10:49.400
Dr. Sasaki...

10:51.900 --> 10:53.570
I don't have the time
to put up with this.

10:54.690 --> 10:56.740
Mastermind's back there.

10:57.360 --> 10:59.070
I'll just go kick his ass.

10:59.660 --> 11:00.450
Wait!

11:07.250 --> 11:08.750
Behind that door...

11:09.920 --> 11:13.210
lies the origin of all
the mutant incidents.

11:14.000 --> 11:15.960
It's a very terrifying existence.

11:16.920 --> 11:17.840
And...

11:19.970 --> 11:21.970
a very precious existence.

11:27.430 --> 11:31.270
The suppressant that
I developed for Kaga and Riko

11:31.270 --> 11:33.610
was something
I originally made for him.

11:34.110 --> 11:39.780
Which means that the origin of
these events is a mutant, correct?

11:41.990 --> 11:46.410
In our last fight with the U-Men,
their leader Obosuki said...

11:47.750 --> 11:50.040
<i>There're monsters here.</i>

11:50.040 --> 11:55.170
<i>Far more dangerous
than you mutants.</i>

11:55.840 --> 11:56.880
That was all.

11:57.500 --> 11:59.130
Furthermore,

11:59.760 --> 12:02.220
he was equipped with a mutant detection
device that could circumvent

12:02.930 --> 12:06.180
your jamming system
as he pleased.

12:06.850 --> 12:08.100
Which means,

12:08.680 --> 12:11.100
you collaborated with the U-Men.

12:11.560 --> 12:12.100
What?!

12:17.480 --> 12:20.320
Our mutant suppressant...

12:20.320 --> 12:25.620
is made from the organs of living
mutants that the U-Men captured.

12:32.000 --> 12:34.880
You knew, and you still used
the suppressant?!

12:37.500 --> 12:42.590
In exchange for them, I built a machine
that blocked mutant detection,

12:42.590 --> 12:46.050
and gave them devices
that circumvented it.

12:46.050 --> 12:51.560
You knew they'd use it to hunt mutants,
and you still did that?!

12:52.140 --> 12:55.060
You're a supporter
of mutant killing!

12:57.440 --> 12:58.610
That's horrible...

12:59.360 --> 13:03.200
How could Dr. Sasaki do such a thing?

13:04.280 --> 13:06.870
There's a limit to what
I can stomach.

13:06.870 --> 13:08.830
How about I gut you right here?!

13:08.830 --> 13:10.330
B-But...

13:10.330 --> 13:12.750
When you consider her feelings...

13:12.750 --> 13:13.540
Why?

13:14.250 --> 13:17.420
Why the hell did you help
mutant hunters?!

13:17.420 --> 13:19.590
You had no choice, right?

13:19.590 --> 13:23.300
After all, if they didn't hunt mutants,
you couldn't get your organs.

13:26.430 --> 13:29.390
I had no other choice.

13:30.260 --> 13:35.310
Regardless, the suppressant's
effects have been weakening,

13:35.310 --> 13:40.070
the power from that "origin of everything"
is starting to leak from the dome,

13:40.070 --> 13:45.110
and there's been an accelerated progression
of Damon Hall syndrome

13:45.110 --> 13:46.660
in the mutants of Tohoku.

13:48.200 --> 13:53.450
You should have contacted Professor X if
the situation became this uncontrollable.

13:53.450 --> 13:55.460
He's a close friend of yours, right?

13:57.000 --> 14:00.500
Who could be in there that
you'd go so far to protect?

14:00.500 --> 14:02.340
This "origin of everything"?

14:03.840 --> 14:07.680
At this rate, everything will go
according to Mastermind's plans.

14:07.680 --> 14:09.890
We must catch him
as quickly as possible!

14:21.900 --> 14:23.150
What's going on?

14:23.860 --> 14:26.860
The closer I get to the dome,
the more it hurts.

14:39.710 --> 14:41.460
Welcome, everyone.

14:41.790 --> 14:43.500
I've been waiting for you.

14:47.930 --> 14:49.180
It's Takeo.

14:50.590 --> 14:51.390
Takeo?

14:53.890 --> 14:57.230
The son of Charles and I.

14:57.230 --> 14:58.060
Charles'...

14:58.560 --> 14:59.310
Son?

14:59.770 --> 15:00.810
It can't be...

15:01.440 --> 15:02.650
you had a child with him?

15:03.110 --> 15:08.610
I didn't know that
Takeo's father was Professor X.

15:09.320 --> 15:12.620
Does Professor X know this?

15:14.080 --> 15:18.210
I told him only when
you entered this house.

15:18.210 --> 15:22.670
Once, during a previous series
of Tohoku mutant incidents,

15:22.670 --> 15:25.250
Professor X came here.

15:25.250 --> 15:28.760
Then, he and Yui fell madly in love.

15:28.760 --> 15:29.760
Or so it goes.

15:31.180 --> 15:33.260
I researched all of it.

15:34.560 --> 15:35.810
That man is...

15:35.810 --> 15:40.520
The man who projected the telepathic
illusion of Sanada Jun, Mastermind.

15:40.520 --> 15:42.020
That's Sanada...

15:42.730 --> 15:47.070
At the time, Sasaki Yui
was pouring her passion

15:47.070 --> 15:50.280
into mutant education
at her school.

15:51.280 --> 15:54.030
But when her son Takeo awakened,

15:54.030 --> 15:57.040
she closed the school and moved
to the remote mountains,

15:57.620 --> 16:01.170
and began researching
a suppressant for Takeo.

16:01.790 --> 16:05.340
She brought those two from
the school as assistants, as well.

16:07.050 --> 16:10.420
Out of respect for Sasaki Yui,

16:10.420 --> 16:13.430
these two have cooperated
with her in researching ways

16:13.430 --> 16:15.760
to suppress Takeo's powers
ever since.

16:15.760 --> 16:18.390
Isn't that right, Kaga, Riko?

16:20.100 --> 16:23.190
But the research did not proceed
as she had hoped.

16:23.850 --> 16:28.360
Once she learned that
fresh mutant organs were the key,

16:28.360 --> 16:31.400
she discarded her
concern for appearances,

16:31.400 --> 16:34.160
and she collaborated with the U-Men
to continue her brutal research

16:34.160 --> 16:36.450
with a hellbent desire
to save her beloved son.

16:37.080 --> 16:42.460
If I may say so, she's more
of a villain than the U-Men.

16:43.370 --> 16:48.300
But she didn't know that the U-Men
were members of the Inner Circle.

16:53.260 --> 16:54.800
When did the U-Men join?

16:55.970 --> 16:59.560
Why would they collaborate
with mutants, their enemies?

17:00.560 --> 17:05.730
Because they reasoned that if we collaborated,
they could kill more mutants.

17:05.730 --> 17:09.940
Therefore, I oversaw their
entry into the Inner Circle.

17:11.490 --> 17:14.070
Takeo's powers are Omega-class.

17:14.530 --> 17:17.450
That level hasn't been
seen since Jean Grey.

17:18.700 --> 17:21.120
If we used that power,

17:21.120 --> 17:24.960
the Inner Circle could put this world
under the control of mutants,

17:24.960 --> 17:28.000
and return it to the way
it was meant to be.

17:28.420 --> 17:34.300
For that reason, I haven't given Takeo
a drop of suppressant in months.

17:34.300 --> 17:35.630
What did you say?!

17:35.630 --> 17:40.100
And I've also been destroying
his mind with telepathy.

17:40.970 --> 17:42.180
How could you do that?

17:42.180 --> 17:43.310
You traitor!

17:47.980 --> 17:51.070
Oh, you've finally arrived.

17:51.070 --> 17:52.400
Neuron.

17:52.400 --> 17:54.150
He's one of the four leaders!

17:55.650 --> 17:56.450
It's dangerous!

17:56.450 --> 17:57.860
Run away, you two!

18:08.630 --> 18:09.500
What's wrong?!

18:18.470 --> 18:19.970
They're dead.

18:19.970 --> 18:20.930
What?

18:20.930 --> 18:21.810
Kaga!

18:22.810 --> 18:23.470
Riko!

18:26.890 --> 18:28.690
How could this happen?

18:30.610 --> 18:32.400
Don't be so shocked.

18:32.400 --> 18:37.900
Since we all die in the end, dying in one
shot is the best way for them to go.

18:37.900 --> 18:39.320
What was that?!

18:41.070 --> 18:46.500
Neuron has the ability to
greatly amplify a person's senses.

18:46.500 --> 18:47.290
Yes.

18:47.290 --> 18:52.000
When I amplify the senses of hearing,
smelling, and pain,

18:52.000 --> 18:56.090
just the sound of a pin dropping
can deliver a shock strong enough

18:56.090 --> 18:58.130
to break the eardrum.

18:58.130 --> 19:02.680
With just a pinch,
the pain kills them by shock.

19:03.430 --> 19:05.520
You bastard!

19:21.410 --> 19:23.200
Decrease in engine output.

19:23.200 --> 19:25.330
<i>At this rate, we will crash.</i>

19:25.790 --> 19:27.410
Decrease in engine output.

19:27.410 --> 19:28.750
<i>At this rate-</i>

19:40.050 --> 19:45.140
Well then, I'll have you
show me your power, Takeo.

19:45.140 --> 19:45.560
Stop it!

19:45.560 --> 19:46.140
Stop!

20:17.130 --> 20:22.090
Now, if you're in pain, feel free to release
your power with all your might.

20:26.140 --> 20:27.850
No!

20:30.980 --> 20:32.020
It hurts!

20:32.020 --> 20:32.980
What is this?

20:46.030 --> 20:47.780
What's that?

20:48.830 --> 20:50.250
It doesn't look good.

20:50.700 --> 20:52.710
Is this a mutant phenomenon?

20:59.920 --> 21:05.010
Right now, the outside world is experiencing
a confusing, mysterious phenomenon.

21:11.890 --> 21:15.560
Don't move,
or your friends are dead.

21:18.570 --> 21:21.900
This is just the beginning.

23:03.920 --> 23:11.180
Mastermind forces Takeo, the child of Professor
X and Yui, to release a tremendous power.

23:12.430 --> 23:16.350
The moment he destroys
the facility and steps outside...

23:16.350 --> 23:19.100
is the moment that the countdown
to the end of the world will begin.

23:20.060 --> 23:24.610
Can his father's voice or his mother's
feelings no longer reach him?

23:25.900 --> 23:31.070
<b><i>Revenge - The End</i></b>

23:25.980 --> 23:29.280
Next time on X-Men: The End
